icle class=\"service-content-box pt-0\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"entry-content\">\r\n                                        \n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><strong>Nissan &amp; Infiniti Key Experts&nbsp;</strong></strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<div align=\"justify\">Nissan and Infiniti vehicles are equipped with advanced locking systems, transponder keys, and Intelligent Key technology that require specialized tools and expertise. Our locksmiths provide professional solutions for a wide range of key, lock, and ignition issues.  Locksmith Express MK delivers services tailored to the specific security system of your vehicle.\n</div><p></p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"/assets/legacy/2026/07/infiniti-vehicle-1024x768.webp\" alt=\"infiniti vehicle\" class=\"wp-image-3804\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<div align=\"justify\">Our fully equipped mobile locksmiths come directly to your location with advanced key-cutting, diagnostic, and programming equipment to complete most services on-site. Whether you drive an older model with a traditional key or a newer vehicle with a push-to-start system, we can restore secure access quickly and efficiently.\n </div>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong><strong>The Right Nissan &amp; Infiniti Locksmith Ensures</strong></strong></h4>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Every service is completed accurately and efficiently</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Professional methods that help prevent unnecessary damage</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Specialized tools and techniques to complete the job</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text is-stacked-on-mobile is-vertically-aligned-center\" style=\"grid-template-columns:53% auto\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"/assets/legacy/2026/07/nissan-vehicle-1024x768.webp\" alt=\"nissan vehicle\" class=\"wp-image-3806 size-full\" /></figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n<h5 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Expert Solutions for Nissan &amp; Infiniti</strong>&nbsp;</h5>\n\n\n\n<div align=\"justify\">Our Nissan &#038; Infiniti locksmith specialists are ready to help, no matter the lock and key you are facing with reliable locksmith services.\n </div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-content-justification-center is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-left is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-0eac79cc wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:0;padding-right:0;padding-bottom:0;padding-left:0\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--2\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"tel:+14134331135\">Call Us Now</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">CAR KEY SERVICES</h3>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover is-light\" style=\"min-height:256px;aspect-ratio:unset;\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-secondary-background-color has-background-dim-20 has-background-dim\"></span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-cover-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8e64cf30 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:0;padding-right:0;padding-bottom:0;padding-left:0\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-top is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"padding-top:0;padding-right:0;padding-bottom:0;padding-left:0\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Lost Keys</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Spare Keys</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Smart Keys</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Key Fob Programming</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-top is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Ignition Repair</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Lockout Service</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Key Duplicated</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Broken Key Extract</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n                                    </div>\r\n                                </article>\r\n\r\n                                <!-- Why Choose Us Box -->\r\n                                                                    <div class=\"service-content-box\">\r\n                                        <h3 class=\"service-box-title\">\r\n                                            Why Trust Us for this Service?                                        </h3>\r\n                                        <div class=\"why-trust-grid\">\r\n                                                                                                <div class=\"why-trust-item\">\r\n                                                        <div class=\"why-trust-icon\">\r\n                                                            <i class=\"fas fa-check-circle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\r\n                                                        </div>\r\n                                                        <div>\r\n                                                            <h4>Accurate Problem Diagnosis</h4>\r\n                                                            <p>We identify whether the issue is the lock, key, latch, strike plate, cylinder, or door alignment before recommending any work.</p>\r\n                                                        </div>\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n                                                                                                    <div class=\"why-trust-item\">\r\n                                                        <div class=\"why-trust-icon\">\r\n                                                            <i class=\"fas fa-check-circle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\r\n                                                        </div>\r\n                                                        <div>\r\n                                                            <h4>Practical Security Solutions</h4>\r\n                                                            <p>We recommend repair, rekeying, replacement, or upgrades based on the condition of the hardware and the security goal of the home.</p>\r\n                                                        </div>\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n                                                                                                    <div class=\"why-trust-item\">\r\n                                                        <div class=\"why-trust-icon\">\r\n                                                            <i class=\"fas fa-check-circle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\r\n                                                        </div>\r\n                                                        <div>\r\n                                                            <h4>Clean Residential Workmanship</h4>\r\n                                                            <p>Our Residential Locksmith service focuses on smooth lock operation, proper fit, and dependable performance under daily use.</p>\r\n                                                        </div>\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n                                                                                                    <div class=\"why-trust-item\">\r\n                                                        <div class=\"why-trust-icon\">\r\n                                                            <i class=\"fas fa-check-circle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\r\n                                                        </div>\r\n                                                        <div>\r\n                                                            <h4>Better Access Control</h4>\r\n                                                            <p>We help homeowners regain control after moving, losing keys, changing occupancy, or upgrading to smarter entry systems.</p>\r\n                                                        </div>\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n                                                                                        </div>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                \r\n                                <!-- How It Works Box -->\r\n                                                                    <div class=\"service-content-box\">\r\n                                        <h3 class=\"service-box-title text-center\">\r\n                                            How Our Service Works                                        </h3>\r\n                                        <div class=\"how-works-grid\">\r\n                                                                                                <div class=\"how-works-step\">\r\n                                                        <div class=\"how-works-number\">1</div>\r\n                                                        <h4>Inspect the Lock and Door</h4>\r\n                                                        <p>We assess the visible issue and the hidden cause, including key wear, cylinder condition, latch alignment, and door hardware fit.</p>\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n                                                                                                    <div class=\"how-works-step\">\r\n                                                        <div class=\"how-works-number\">2</div>\r\n                                                        <h4>Recommend the Right Fix</h4>\r\n                                                        <p>We explain whether repair, rekeying, replacement, or an upgrade is the smartest option for the home.</p>\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n                                                                                                    <div class=\"how-works-step\">\r\n                                                        <div class=\"how-works-number\">3</div>\r\n                                                        <h4>Complete the Work and Test Everything</h4>\r\n                                                        <p>We finish the service, verify smooth operation, and make sure the lock functions correctly from both sides.</p>\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n                                                                                        </div>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                \r\n                                <!-- FAQs Box -->\r\n                                                                    <div class=\"service-content-box\">\r\n                                        <h3 class=\"service-box-title\">\r\n                                            Frequently Asked Questions                                        </h3>\r\n                                        <div>\r\n                                                                                                <details class=\"faq-item\">\r\n                                                        <summary>\r\n                                                            <span>Can You Replace a Damaged Nissan or Infiniti Key Shell?</span>\r\n                                                            <i class=\"fas fa-chevron-down\"></i>\r\n                                                        </summary>\r\n                                                        <div class=\"faq-answer\">\r\n                                                            <p>Yes. If the internal electronics and transponder chip are still working, we can replace the damaged key shell without replacing the entire key. This helps restore the key&#039;s appearance and functionality while offering a more cost-effective solution.</p>\r\n                                                        </div>\r\n                                                    </details>\r\n                                                                                                    <details class=\"faq-item\">\r\n                                                        <summary>\r\n                                                            <span>My Key Turns, But My Nissan Won&#039;t Start. What Could Be Wrong?</span>\r\n                                                            <i class=\"fas fa-chevron-down\"></i>\r\n                                                        </summary>\r\n                                                        <div class=\"faq-answer\">\r\n                                                            <p>Your Nissan may not start due to a key, transponder, programming, or ignition issue. We can inspect the system and find the cause.</p>\r\n                                                        </div>\r\n                                                    </details>\r\n                                                                                                    <details class=\"faq-item\">\r\n                                                        <summary>\r\n                                                            <span>How Long Does It Take to Replace and Program a Nissan or Infiniti Key?</span>\r\n                                                            <i class=\"fas fa-chevron-down\"></i>\r\n                                                        </summary>\r\n                                                        <div class=\"faq-answer\">\r\n                                                            <p>The time required depends on your vehicle&#039;s model, year, and the type of key you need. In most cases, key cutting and programming can be completed during a single visit, allowing you to get back on the road as quickly as possible.</p>\r\n                                                        </div>\r\n                                                    </details>\r\n                                                                                                    <details class=\"faq-item\">\r\n                                                        <summary>\r\n                                                            <span>Can You Replace a Lost Nissan or Infiniti Key Without the Original?</span>\r\n                                                            <i class=\"fas fa-chevron-down\"></i>\r\n                                                        </summary>\r\n                                                        <div class=\"faq-answer\">\r\n                                                            <p>Yes. Our locksmiths can cut and program a new key even if you&#039;ve lost your only key. Using your vehicle&#039;s information and specialized programming equipment, we can create a replacement key that&#039;s compatible with your Nissan or Infiniti.</p>\r\n                                                        </div>\r\n                                                    </details>\r\n                                                                                                    <details class=\"faq-item\">\r\n                                                        <summary>\r\n                                                            <span>What Should I Do If My Nissan Intelligent Key Isn&#039;t Working?</span>\r\n                                                            <i class=\"fas fa-chevron-down\"></i>\r\n                                                        </summary>\r\n                                                        <div class=\"faq-answer\">\r\n                                                            <p>If your Nissan Intelligent Key isn&#039;t working, the problem could be a depleted battery, a programming issue, or a damaged key fob. Our locksmiths can diagnose the cause and suggest the required solution.</p>\r\n                                                        </div>\r\n                                                    </details>\r\n                                                                                        </div>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                \r\n                            </div> <!-- End Left Column -->\r\n\r\n                            <!-- Right Column: Sidebar -->\r\n                            <div class=\"service-sidebar\">\r\n                                <div class=\"service-sidebar-inner\">\r\n\r\n                                    <!-- Services Nav -->\r\n                                    <div class=\"sidebar-box\">\r\n                                        <div class=\"sidebar-box-header\">\r\n                                            <h3>All Services</h3>\r\n                                        </div>\r\n                                        <ul class=\"service-list\">\r\n                                                                                                <li class=\"service-list-item\">\r\n                                                        <a href=\"/services/automotive-locksmith/\"\r\n                                                            class=\"service-list-link \">\r\n                                                            <i class=\"fas fa-key\"></i>\r\n                                                            Automotive Locksmith                                                        </a>\r\n                                                    </li>\r\n                                                                                                        <li class=\"service-list-item\">\r\n                                                